{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "VAGRIENT",
    "steam_appid": 2681570,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEW EXPANSION HAS ARRIVED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/533478581a0e4e5a99979ca077df0cfd.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Since the defeat of Cerbacore and restoration of the corrupted Warpgate, a place deep beneath the Ice Ruins has been exposed waiting to be explored. Take on the challenge of this new-found location and be rewarded!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion features updated graphics, new content, quality of life improvements, adjustments and bug fixes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLO DEVELOPED</strong><br><strong>  DEBUT TITLE </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VAGRIENT is a unique everlasting adventure with future expansion updates to come!<br>It provides a compelling, non-linear and open world experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIRST CHAPTER: BRINK OF WAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vagrient, an Armlys alien separated from his clan at war in another solar system. A corrupted warpgate stands between, placing a halt to his return. Power must be restored to the gate. Defeating the 5 Titans across Zharnuu Prime will award Vagrient the special energy required to complete the objective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagrient isn't alone though, he has his trusty companion &quot;Sentinel&quot; by his side to not only guide him through the journey but also to fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use warpgates to travel from one planet to another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast solar system of planets containing what Vagrient desires </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat with other entities whilst managing energy output and consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the unique Titan bosses, learn and strategize against there moves  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle any puzzles and obstacles that get in the way of the main objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new skills, allowing for different movement and combat techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Extra content unlocked after game completion, utilising the Steam Leaderboards feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus lots of other exciting content to uncover and experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills Interface</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View and manage your active skills in this simple, easy to use interface!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abyss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players on the Steam Leaderboard to become #1 by doing Abyss runs. The player must defeat as many Omens as they can in a single timed run and survive. Use your acquired skills and items to create the optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Totems can spawn that have different effects when collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem - Overtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increases remaining run time, allowing the player to stay longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem -\u00a0Annihilation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant defeat of all Omens on the screen, this can really boost the current score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem - Energize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replenishes all energy to max, can be a life saver when energies are drained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is unlocked after First Chapter completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>NOTE:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended display resolution is 1080p. If the user's monitor has a different native resolution and are experiencing display issues, change the resolution to 1920x1080.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NEW EXPANSION HAS ARRIVED</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/533478581a0e4e5a99979ca077df0cfd.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Since the defeat of Cerbacore and restoration of the corrupted Warpgate, a place deep beneath the Ice Ruins has been exposed waiting to be explored. Take on the challenge of this new-found location and be rewarded!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion features updated graphics, new content, quality of life improvements, adjustments and bug fixes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLO DEVELOPED</strong><br><strong>  DEBUT TITLE </strong><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/35262c77493479cf61aab14939bae9f5.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VAGRIENT is a unique everlasting adventure with future expansion updates to come!<br>It provides a compelling, non-linear and open world experience.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE FIRST CHAPTER: BRINK OF WAR</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Vagrient, an Armlys alien separated from his clan at war in another solar system. A corrupted warpgate stands between, placing a halt to his return. Power must be restored to the gate. Defeating the 5 Titans across Zharnuu Prime will award Vagrient the special energy required to complete the objective!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vagrient isn't alone though, he has his trusty companion &quot;Sentinel&quot; by his side to not only guide him through the journey but also to fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use warpgates to travel from one planet to another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast solar system of planets containing what Vagrient desires </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat with other entities whilst managing energy output and consumption</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the unique Titan bosses, learn and strategize against there moves  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle any puzzles and obstacles that get in the way of the main objective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new skills, allowing for different movement and combat techniques</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Extra content unlocked after game completion, utilising the Steam Leaderboards feature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus lots of other exciting content to uncover and experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills Interface</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View and manage your active skills in this simple, easy to use interface!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9804175925c80471e8f4445f3fa41614.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Abyss</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other players on the Steam Leaderboard to become #1 by doing Abyss runs. The player must defeat as many Omens as they can in a single timed run and survive. Use your acquired skills and items to create the optimal build!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abyssal Totems can spawn that have different effects when collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem - Overtime</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increases remaining run time, allowing the player to stay longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/50499e8f5df98fa12881177e765ef844.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem -\u00a0Annihilation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant defeat of all Omens on the screen, this can really boost the current score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/9a4c04efe13353d7781ebd62b2d6787b.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abyssal Totem - Energize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replenishes all energy to max, can be a life saver when energies are drained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.poster.avif?t=1754773794\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.webm?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2681570/extras/5478b31184b10d93725e761e007358d0.mp4?t=1754773794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Abyss is unlocked after First Chapter completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>NOTE:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommended display resolution is 1080p. If the user's monitor has a different native resolution and are experiencing display issues, change the resolution to 1920x1080.</strong></p>",
